{"date":"2025-09-20","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_93e816a0d72f7642b2ffbf11c8dfe21f","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1758360600,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-09-17","chunk":0,"id":"m_ba4149e7d275c9791ae8a05f068552a3"}}},{"id":"m_d3b46e202baaa0585f61b297980cbc2d","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1758360637,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_39857d1ce8adbeb41690659e3ac8a1cd","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1758360674,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3291f5f82723fa9daa0acb1af2d1edd9","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1758360711,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7f1d77cd82a63b290f6e235c3da7a151","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1758360748,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5527d186c67ab87526d1b76b7bf5545c","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1758360785,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5c36da6b3f231b17617d54ebd5bf5d18","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1758360822,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_570b9ded3fb58cf4244ab6505d6b5a49","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1758360859,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c6bada0f7a82800ac612267f1df9d8dc","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1758360896,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b27aaf92f98057001ab0078329a172fe","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1758360933,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9d29457728cb9150e8c905d4570d13c7","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1758360970,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_60b36e43013dc295dcd11fc7561fad4b","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1758361007,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_44387acb394f20f511956cb6aa784f59","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1758361044,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e3ecc493037421b149471fbffe175c2d","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1758361081,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3d6fc6be3454c44e7bf42247f37219f6","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1758361118,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d577fdc875382a221b9e06e5e5095aa7","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1758361155,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_19a2f1b8b74ebe309452d89c18795a33","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1758361192,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_332fa70751ad5e82b284e8800c0e1ee7","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1758361229,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5dac7fe9e6eb86094bf36a5a37461ba6","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1758361266,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e41bbcbc22e1b73e6c8c99a59ae7240f","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1758361303,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f5078b893d99c4457919b26f1ddd594d","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1758361340,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ac80b9b68a3af08d056ee527dd473e95","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1758361377,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6de469fdd7c8217fbff67edcd9c3d98c","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1758361414,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7044acb10ccb8654d0bda007820306c8","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1758361451,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
